      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.06,
          "end": 5.38,
          "en": "So we got this input box styled a little bit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.38,
          "end": 6.74,
          "en": "which is nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.74,
          "end": 9.61,
          "en": "Now let's work on the elements in that box again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.61,
          "end": 11.8,
          "en": "on the input element and the buttons;",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.8,
          "end": 14.53,
          "en": "which aren't really buttons, at this point.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.53,
          "end": 17.11,
          "en": "We just have a view with a text inside of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.11,
          "end": 19.44,
          "en": "It's not pressable at all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.44,
          "end": 21.81,
          "en": "Now I will work on the buttons in a second step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.81,
          "end": 24.403,
          "en": "I wanna start with the input element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26,
          "end": 29.29,
          "en": "And for this in the start game screen component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.29,
          "end": 32.62,
          "en": "I'll add another style object in this style sheet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.62,
          "end": 35.22,
          "en": "And this style object will be responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.22,
          "end": 37.22,
          "en": "for styling the input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.22,
          "end": 39.12,
          "en": "Therefore I'll name it, input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.12,
          "end": 42.94,
          "en": "or text input or number input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.94,
          "end": 46.02,
          "en": "since the goal is users enter a number in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.02,
          "end": 48.99,
          "en": "But as you know, the name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.99,
          "end": 51.42,
          "en": "Now this will be assigned to this text input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.42,
          "end": 55.13,
          "en": "by adding this style property to this text input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.13,
          "end": 59.34,
          "en": "styles.numberInput, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.34,
          "end": 63.14,
          "en": "And now the styles I do want to add are the following.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.14,
          "end": 66.28,
          "en": "I wanna give this a height of let's say 50 pixels,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.28,
          "end": 69.44,
          "en": "to have a fixed height on this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.44,
          "end": 72.43,
          "en": "And I want to give the text in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.43,
          "end": 76.07,
          "en": "a font size of let's say 32,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.07,
          "end": 79.1,
          "en": "to have a nice big text in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.1,
          "end": 84.1,
          "en": "In addition, I wanna change the color of the bottom border.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.63,
          "end": 87.26,
          "en": "I wanna set this to a nice yellow color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.26,
          "end": 89.47,
          "en": "which I also prepared in advance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.47,
          "end": 94.32,
          "en": "and that would be the hex code, ddb52f, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.89,
          "end": 97.32,
          "en": "This is a nice yellow color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.32,
          "end": 99.57,
          "en": "and that's the color I want to use here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.57,
          "end": 102.46000000000001,
          "en": "And of course it's probably clear anyways",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.46000000000001,
          "end": 105.6,
          "en": "but definitely feel free to play around with those colors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.6,
          "end": 107.203,
          "en": "and choose your own colors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.03999999999999,
          "end": 111.61,
          "en": "Now, the border color is not the only thing we need to set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.61,
          "end": 115.43,
          "en": "We also should set the border bottom width here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.43,
          "end": 117.95,
          "en": "to make sure that we can see this bottom border.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.95,
          "end": 120.07,
          "en": "And for this I'll crank up the width a little bit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.07,
          "end": 122.113,
          "en": "and set it to two pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.35,
          "end": 126.85,
          "en": "Now, I also wanna change the color of the text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.85,
          "end": 129.26,
          "en": "that is entered in this input field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 129.26,
          "end": 132.82,
          "en": "and I'll set it to the same yellow as we have it up here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.82,
          "end": 134.233,
          "en": "for the border bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.79,
          "end": 139.27,
          "en": "So here I add the same string with the same hex code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 139.27,
          "end": 143.27,
          "en": "Now it would also be nice to have some empty space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 143.27,
          "end": 145.63,
          "en": "above and below the text input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.63,
          "end": 148.11,
          "en": "And this can be achieved with margin,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.11,
          "end": 149.14,
          "en": "but to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 149.14,
          "end": 150.81,
          "en": "with margin vertical,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 150.81,
          "end": 152.68,
          "en": "which adds the same amount of space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 152.68,
          "end": 154.32,
          "en": "to the top and bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.32,
          "end": 157.163,
          "en": "And here, I want to add eight pixels of space.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 158.12,
          "end": 159.03,
          "en": "Last but not least,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 159.03,
          "end": 160.93,
          "en": "I'll set the font weight to bold,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 160.93,
          "end": 163.57,
          "en": "to make sure that we have some nice, bold text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 163.57,
          "end": 164.873,
          "en": "that's being entered here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 165.92000000000002,
          "end": 167.6,
          "en": "With that, if we save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 167.6,
          "end": 170.16,
          "en": "we got this yellow border at the bottom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 170.16,
          "end": 174.53,
          "en": "and if I start typing here, this looks quite nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 174.53,
          "end": 178.36,
          "en": "I just think that it's a little bit too wide.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 178.36,
          "end": 181.21,
          "en": "We don't need that wide of a input field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 181.21,
          "end": 184.61,
          "en": "because we only enter a two digit number in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 184.61,
          "end": 186.9,
          "en": "or maybe just a one digit number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 186.9,
          "end": 189.49,
          "en": "but definitely nothing longer than that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 189.49,
          "end": 191.68,
          "en": "At the moment, you can enter anything in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 191.68,
          "end": 193.58,
          "en": "but we will soon and restrict this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 193.58,
          "end": 197.16,
          "en": "and we won't allow values higher than 99.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 197.16,
          "end": 199.07999999999998,
          "en": "So, this is way too big,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 199.07999999999998,
          "end": 201.253,
          "en": "way too wide of a input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 202.12,
          "end": 205.92000000000002,
          "en": "Now, to control the width of this input element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 205.92000000000002,
          "end": 207.63,
          "en": "we can use Styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 207.63,
          "end": 210.61,
          "en": "but actually not just Styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 210.61,
          "end": 212.07,
          "en": "But let's start with the styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 212.07,
          "end": 215.12,
          "en": "and then talk about the other thing that we can do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 215.12,
          "end": 216.64,
          "en": "Here on the number input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 216.64,
          "end": 219.53,
          "en": "I wanna make sure that this is shorter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 219.53,
          "end": 220.95,
          "en": "that it's not as wide.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 220.95,
          "end": 223.61,
          "en": "And we can do this by setting a width here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 223.61,
          "end": 226.07,
          "en": "on this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 226.07,
          "end": 228.42000000000002,
          "en": "And the width could be 50 pixels as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 228.42000000000002,
          "end": 231.01,
          "en": "though you can of course play around with that value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 231.01,
          "end": 235.01,
          "en": "to find a fitting with that looks best for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 235.01,
          "end": 238.19,
          "en": "If I saved this, this is now way shorter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 238.19,
          "end": 240.37,
          "en": "It would be nice if the text would be centered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 240.37,
          "end": 241.203,
          "en": "in there though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 241.203,
          "end": 243.12,
          "en": "And this is something which can be achieved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 243.12,
          "end": 244.76,
          "en": "with a styling property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 244.76,
          "end": 246.8,
          "en": "that you might know from the browser;",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 246.8,
          "end": 250.833,
          "en": "Because that's the textAlign property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 252.16,
          "end": 254.54,
          "en": "We can set this to center,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 254.54,
          "end": 257.24,
          "en": "to center the text in its containers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 257.24,
          "end": 260.15,
          "en": "So, in this input element, in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 260.15,
          "end": 263.26,
          "en": "If we save that, the text is centered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 263.26,
          "end": 266.05,
          "en": "Now the overall input element is not centered yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 266.05,
          "end": 267.95,
          "en": "we will do it as in a later step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 267.95,
          "end": 270.41,
          "en": "but it is now shorter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 270.41,
          "end": 271.74,
          "en": "However, at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 271.74,
          "end": 274.29,
          "en": "you can still enter super long numbers in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 274.29,
          "end": 277.31,
          "en": "which causes this input element to become scrollable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 277.31,
          "end": 279.84000000000003,
          "en": "and I don't want to be able to do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 279.84000000000003,
          "end": 282.99,
          "en": "I want to make sure, that users can only enter numbers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 282.99,
          "end": 287.03,
          "en": "between one and 99, into this input element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 287.03,
          "end": 291.32,
          "en": "And therefore we'll have at most two digits, two characters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 291.32,
          "end": 293.14,
          "en": "that will be entered here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 293.14,
          "end": 296.72,
          "en": "And this can be achieved by adding a special prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 296.72,
          "end": 301.09,
          "en": "to text input, the maxlength prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 301.09,
          "end": 305.34,
          "en": "Now, this prop takes the max number of characters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 305.34,
          "end": 308.38,
          "en": "that can be inserted into this input element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 308.38,
          "end": 311.173,
          "en": "So we could try to set this equal to two.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 312.27,
          "end": 316.26,
          "en": "If we do that though, we get an error, also here;",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 316.26,
          "end": 319.6,
          "en": "On Android it crashed entirely, also nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 319.6,
          "end": 321.32,
          "en": "And if we have a look at this error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 321.32,
          "end": 322.71,
          "en": "we see that in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 322.71,
          "end": 325.25,
          "en": "we have a problem with the type I chose.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 325.25,
          "end": 329.053,
          "en": "I chose type string, but expected is type number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 330.78,
          "end": 332.54,
          "en": "And that indeed is the problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 332.54,
          "end": 335.72,
          "en": "We provided a string here by using quotes;",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 335.72,
          "end": 338.32,
          "en": "Yes, it's a prop value, but it is a string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 338.32,
          "end": 340.26,
          "en": "we're using quotes here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 340.26,
          "end": 343.38,
          "en": "What we should pass in instead, is a number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 343.38,
          "end": 346.81,
          "en": "and this can be done by using curly braces instead of quotes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 346.81,
          "end": 348.51,
          "en": "and then passing the number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 348.51,
          "end": 351.05,
          "en": "between those curly braces, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 351.05,
          "end": 354.22,
          "en": "If I save this, now I don't have the error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 354.22,
          "end": 357.3,
          "en": "And now if I try to enter more than two characters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 357.3,
          "end": 358.32,
          "en": "it doesn't work;",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 358.32,
          "end": 362.01,
          "en": "I'm hammering my keys on the keyboard, but nothing happens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 362.01,
          "end": 364.67,
          "en": "I can enter two characters at most,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 364.67,
          "end": 366.663,
          "en": "and that's exactly what I want here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 367.62,
          "end": 370.96,
          "en": "Now, I will try to restart this on Android,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 370.96,
          "end": 373.97,
          "en": "so that we can also preview it there again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 373.97,
          "end": 377.03,
          "en": "Sometimes it can crash like this;",
          "zh": ""
        },
